# C5 Matter: one published folder, two archives (Wi-Fi vs Matter-over-Thread).
# Arduino IDE picks via Tools → Matter Network. PIO has no menu: Wi-Fi is
# the documented default; set ARDUINO_MATTER_NETWORK_THREAD for .thread.a.
# copy-libs.sh keeps the unsuffixed libespressif__esp_matter.a off the
# default LIBS line so the wrong archive is never pulled in.
#
